Howdy, Hackers!

     Well, my 2 cents for the debugging nightmare:

When you quit from patch 7 of Macnethack on a IIcx 
(with color), and ask it to print your inventory,
it only works right if your inventory is less than one 
page long.  If it is longer, it tries to print the
list on the left, instead of the right, and the screen
updates over it, leaving only the first line visible.
The second page is readable, but overall this is pretty
annoying.

The other strange thing I have noticed so far is the 
fact that double-clicking on a save file doesn't run it.
This might have something to do with the fact that that
I had Patch 5 on the machine when I unpacked the arcive.
Interestingly enough, if I put pl 5 back on, the save 
file tries to run the pl7 save from 5.  And does neat and
interesting things.  

Another couple bugs when I get a chance to write them
down and bring them over here, since my dorm isn't 
networked (grrrrr).

